            <title>[IGNITE-26832] Incorrect buffer size for reading RecoveryLastReceivedMessage on handshake</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-26832</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The message use long, currently we hold 8 bytes for reading the value, but actually in worst case it requires 10 bytes (due to varlen coding).&lt;/p&gt;

